{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13108","headline":"詶李郎中侍御秋夜登福州城楼见寄 · 皇甫冉","name":"詶李郎中侍御秋夜登福州城楼见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辛勤万里道，箫索九秋残。\n月照闽中夜，天凝海上寒。\n王程无地远，主意在人安。\n遥寄登楼作，空知行路难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}